route","start":159.75,"end":160.19},{"word":"so","start":160.19,"end":160.47},{"word":"rough","start":160.47,"end":160.87},{"word":"and","start":160.87,"end":161.11},{"word":"steep","start":161.11,"end":161.67},{"word":"that","start":161.67,"end":161.91},{"word":"climbing","start":161.91,"end":162.47},{"word":"will","start":162.47,"end":162.67},{"word":"seem","start":162.67,"end":162.95},{"word":"like","start":162.95,"end":163.19},{"word":"play","start":163.19,"end":163.59},{"word":"from","start":163.59,"end":163.83},{"word":"now","start":163.83,"end":164.15},{"word":"on.\"","start":164.15,"end":164.55}]},{"id":19,"speaker":"narrator","text":"When the souls saw me breathing,\nrealizing I was still alive,\nthey turned pale with amazement.\nLike people crowding around a messenger\nwho carries an olive branch,\neager for news and unafraid of the crush,\nso all those blessed spirits stood motionless,\nas if forgetting they should go\nand make themselves beautiful.\nI saw one step forward\nwith such loving intention to embrace me\nthat I was moved to do the same.\nO empty shadows, real only in appearance!\nThree times I tried to clasp him in my arms,\nthree times my hands returned empty to my chest.\nWonder must have shown on my face,\nbecause the shade smiled and stepped back.\nI pressed forward, following.\nGently he said I should stop,\nand then I knew who he was.\nI begged him to stay and speak with me.","startTime":164.55,"endTime":215.65,"words":[{"word":"When","start":164.77,"end":164.93},{"word":"the","start":164.93,"end":165.09},{"word":"souls","start":165.09,"end":165.543},{"word":"saw","start":165.543,"end":165.73},{"word":"me","start":165.73,"end":165.97},{"word":"breathing,","start":165.97,"end":166.85},{"word":"realizing","start":166.85,"end":167.49},{"word":"I","start":167.49,"end":167.597},{"word":"was","start":167.597,"end":167.77},{"word":"still","start":167.77,"end":168.17},{"word":"alive,","start":168.17,"end":168.85},{"word":"they","start":168.85,"en